  "alternateName": [
    "PyHealth 2.0"
  ],
  "description": "Open-source Python toolkit for clinical deep learning that unifies datasets, tasks, and ML models across EHR, physiological signals, and medical imaging into a single 5-stage pipeline API. Supports 20+ clinical datasets, 26+ standardised clinical prediction tasks, and 33+ models with built-in explainability and conformal prediction.",
