  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "PyHealth 2.0 (Jan 2026) is the most comprehensive unified Python framework for clinical AI, covering EHR, signals, and imaging in a single coherent API. Benchmarks show 39× faster loading than pandas and 20× less memory than pandarallel on MIMIC-IV. Active community (400+ Discord), pip-installable, peer-reviewed paper, and a structured research initiative. The main caveat is academic governance (single lab) rather than a foundation — watch for bus-factor risk as with most academic open-source.",
